    "short_and_long": "E(t)=hyperbolaE(actualCorrelationLogarithmicTest t)(actualCorrelationCutoff(t)/2); T(t)=exp(-t/2)*B(t). Existing exact source identities give P(t)=2E(t)-T(t).",
